# Stage-2 configuration (PLACEHOLDER): TDC becomes the only convection path and the old MLT is deleted. Until then it is the grey
# configuration plus the switches that select TDC in today's code. When Stage 2 is cut: remove the switch lines below (they become
# unconditional), keep the rest, and make the Stage-1 T2/T3 metrics the --ref of the first Stage-2 gate run.
# NOTE: checkpoints of the library (states.txt) are only restartable with the configuration they were written with.
@include config_grey.env
TDC=1
TDCPAR=1,1,1,1,0.01,1,0
CONVDIAG=1
